  setIsGenerating(false);
  setGeneratingAgent(null);
  setShowInput(true);
}
```

Early returns and session-switch detection now also restore state unconditionally.

### Expanded session reset cleanup

`resetSessionUIState()` now clears all loading/generating flags:
- `setIsGenerating(false)`
- `setGeneratingAgent(null)`
- `setIsSending(false)`
- `setIsMessagesLoading(false)`

Prevents state leakage when switching sessions or creating new chats.

### Weakened full-screen spinner condition

```javascript
// Before: {isMessagesLoading ? (
{isMessagesLoading && messages.length === 0 ? (
```

Shows spinner only when truly empty. Preserves visibility of optimistic/existing messages during snapshot loading.

### Optimistic session title fallback

```javascript
const [optimisticSessionTitles, setOptimisticSessionTitles] = useState({});

// On session creation
setOptimisticSessionTitles(prev => ({ ...prev, [sid]: fallbackTitle }));

// Header display
{sessions.find(s => s.id === currentSessionId)?.title || 
 optimisticSessionTitles[currentSessionId] || 
